diff --git a/tools/gameplay-eval/EVIDENCE.md b/tools/gameplay-eval/EVIDENCE.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..e6a1368
--- /dev/null
+++ b/tools/gameplay-eval/EVIDENCE.md
@@ -0,0 +1,37 @@
+# Lane A evidence (streamer reactions) — 2026-11-17
+
+Labels: **SYNTHETIC** = generated by tools/gameplay-eval/make_*.py, built and tuned by the same author.
+**REAL** = real Twitch VOD sample, private, never committed (test-footage/ is git-ignored).
+
